[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mTransactional event log (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mAppend-only task_events table written in the same transaction as each mutation; ordered, durable, replayable.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m In-process emitter
     [38;5;246mMutations emit events in memory to subscribers. Least code, nothing persisted, nothing replayable.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m Full event sourcing
     [38;5;246mEvents are the source of truth; task state is a projection rebuilt from them.[39m
